      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5e44a1bd0c91c2477a8b8acb|full_name}: I'd argue that there already is segregation. Between Quest/PC and people who have to block more intense avatars. Plus all of the worlds that already enforce avatar limits and exclude/kick people for it.\nCould even argue that this might allow more people to have a better experience by helping users to encourage more efficient avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "60f17c1a8a26507c9a61f17c",
      "author": {
        "_id": "600bb08cb76d6f78b108fb38",
        "alias": "Zircon Yak",
        "aliasID": "65c26de3ed6eefce4c583db2",
