  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-07T21:05:24.310Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice to be able to get the rank of an avatar via Udon to allow for world creators to filter out players above a certain threshold. (e.g. You load into a room and have to click a door handle to teleport out, the door handle doesn't work if your rank is \"Very Poor\") This would make managing high-capacity worlds a bit easier and reduce the need to manually check everyone who enters.",
